note GDN builders (src/omega_blackwell_codegen_gdn.c): decode, multi-token decode, state copy, prefill prep, scan, post.
note The vreg ids live in the state s (new ulong 512); a slot is only a name, the allocation order is the C order.
note Parameters: s500 mutant, s501 ratio r, s502 state_bf16, s503 par_scal, s504 par_norm, s505 vh, s506 vdim,
note s507 conv, s508 copy, s509 state element bytes (4, or 2 for bf16).
note Scoreboards: 3 the held state quads, 4 the held gate and norm weight.  Prefetch op words: 825 LDG.E.128 under 3,
note 824 LDG.E.64 under 3, 1081 LDG.E.128 under 4.  MUFU: 47 EX2, 40 RCP, 41 RSQ, 59 LG2.
note Float bits: 3216550459 -log2 e, 1065353216 one, 1069066811 log2 e, 3212836864 -1, 1060205080 ln 2,
note 1006632960 1/128, 1035273459 1/sqrt 128, 1063870306 one minus that.
